This work follows the structure and conventions established by the Gamma-ray Data Tools: Fermi
package (gdt-fermi), developed by the same authors, which served as the design model for this
BurstCube plugin.

This work also draws on the BurstCube team's own analysis tools (bctools), in particular the
detector response interpolation scheme implemented in
`bctools.io.InstrumentResponse.get_drm`.

